{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zec-11-1","title":"Zechariah 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The destruction of Jerusalem. 3 The elect being cared for, the rest are rejected. 10 The staves of Beauty and Bands broken by the rejection of Christ. 15 The type and curse of a foolish shepherd.</p>\n<p>O Lebanon. 10:10; Jer 22:6,7,23; Hab 2:8,17; Hag 1:8 that. 14:1,2; De 32:22; Mt 24:1,2; Lu 19:41-44; 21:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-2","title":"Zechariah 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Howl. Isa 2:12-17; 10:33,34; Eze 31:2,3,17; Am 6:1; Na 3:8-19; Lu 23:31 mighty. or, gallants. for. Isa 32:15-19; Eze 20:46 forest of the vintage. or, defenced forest.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-3","title":"Zechariah 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>a voice. 8,15-17; Jer 25:34-36; Joe 1:13; Am 8:8; Zep 1:10; Mt 15:14 Mt 23:13-33; Jas 5:1-6 for their. 1Sa 4:21,22; Isa 65:15; Jer 7:4,11-14; 26:6; Eze 24:21-25 Ho 1:9,10; 10:5; Zep 3:11; Mt 3:7-10; 21:43-45; Ac 6:11-14; 22:21,22 Ro 11:7-12 a voice. Ps 22:21; Jer 2:30; Eze 19:3-6; Zep 3:3; Mt 23:31-38; Ac 7:52 for the pride. Jer 49:19; 50:44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-4","title":"Zechariah 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Lord. 14:5; Isa 49:4,5; Joh 20:17; Eph 1:3 Feed. 7; Isa 40:9-11; Eze 34:23,24; Mic 5:4; Mt 15:24; 23:37; Lu 19:41-44 Joh 21:15-17; Ro 15:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-5","title":"Zechariah 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>possessors. Jer 23:1,2; Eze 22:25-27; 34:2,3,10; Mic 3:1-3,9-12; Mt 23:14 Joh 16:2 hold. Jer 2:3; 50:7 sell. Ge 37:26-28; 2Ki 4:1; Ne 5:8; Mt 21:12,13; 2Pe 2:3; Re 18:13 Blessed. De 29:19-21; Ho 12:8; 1Ti 6:5-10 and their. Eze 34:4,6,18,19,21; Joh 10:1,12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-6","title":"Zechariah 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I will no. 5; Isa 27:11; Eze 8:18; 9:10; Ho 1:6; Mt 18:33-35; 22:7; 23:35-38 Lu 19:43,44; 21:22-24; 1Th 2:16; Heb 10:26-31; Jas 2:13 deliver. Heb. make to be found. 9,14; 8:10; Isa 3:5; 9:19-21; Jer 13:14; Mic 7:2-7; Hag 2:22 Mt 10:21,34-36; 24:10; Lu 12:52,53; 21:16,17 into the. Da 9:26,27; Mt 22:7; Joh 19:15 they shall. Mal 4:6 and out. Ps 50:22; Ho 2:10; Mic 5:8; 6:14; Heb 2:3; 10:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-7","title":"Zechariah 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I will. 4,11; 13:8,9 even you, O poor. or, verily the poor. Isa 11:4; 61:1; Jer 5:4,5; Zep 3:12; Mt 11:5; Mr 12:37; Jas 2:5 staves. 10,14; Le 27:32; 1Sa 17:40,43; Ps 23:4 one. Ps 133:1-3; Eze 37:16-23; Joh 17:21-23 Bands. or, Binders. Joh 10:16; Eph 2:13-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-8","title":"Zechariah 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>in. Ho 5:7; Mt 23:34-36; 24:50,51 and my. Le 26:11,30,44; De 32:19; Ps 5:5; 78:9; 106:40; Jer 12:8; 14:21 Ho 9:15; Heb 10:38 lothed them. Heb. was straitened for them. Isa 49:7; Lu 12:50; 19:14; Joh 7:7; 15:18,23-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-9","title":"Zechariah 11:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I will. Jer 23:33,39; Mt 13:10,11; 21:43; 23:38,39; Joh 8:21,24; 12:35 Ac 13:46,47; 28:26-28 that that dieth. Ps 69:22-28; Jer 15:2,3; 43:11; Mt 15:14; 21:19; Re 22:11 and let. De 28:53-56; Isa 9:19-21; Jer 19:9; Eze 5:10 another. Heb. his fellow, or, neighbour.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-10","title":"Zechariah 11:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Beauty. 7; Ps 50:2; 90:17; Eze 7:20-22; 24:21; Da 9:26; Lu 21:5,6,32 Ac 6:13,14; Ro 9:3-5 that. Nu 14:34; 1Sa 2:30; Ps 89:39; Jer 14:21; 31:31,32; Eze 16:59-61 Ho 1:9; Ga 3:16-18; Heb 7:17-22; 8:8-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-11","title":"Zechariah 11:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>so, etc. or, the poor of the flock, etc., certainly knew.poor. 7; Ps 69:33; 72:12-14; Isa 14:32; Zep 3:12; Lu 7:22; 19:48; Jas 2:5,6 that waited. Isa 8:17; 26:8,9; 40:31; La 3:25,26; Mic 7:7; Lu 2:25,38; 23:51 Ac 1:21,22 knew. 6; Le 26:38-46; De 28:49-68; 31:21,29; 32:21-42; Lu 24:49-53 Ro 11:7-12; Jas 5:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-12","title":"Zechariah 11:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>ye think good. Heb. it be good in your eyes. 1Ki 21:2; 2Ch 30:4; *margins give. Mt 26:15; Joh 13:2,27-30 So. Ge 37:28; Ex 21:32; Mt 26:15; Mr 14:10,11; Lu 22:3-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-13","title":"Zechariah 11:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Cast. Isa 54:7-10; Mt 27:3-10,12; Ac 1:18,19 a goodly. Isa 53:2,3; Ac 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-14","title":"Zechariah 11:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>I cut. 9; Isa 9:21; 11:13; Eze 37:16-20; Mt 24:10; Ac 23:7-10; Ga 5:15 Jas 3:14,16; 4:1-3 Bands. or, Binders. 7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-15","title":"Zechariah 11:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>a foolish. Isa 6:10-12; Jer 2:26,27; La 2:14; Eze 13:3; Mt 15:14; 23:17 Lu 11:40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-16","title":"Zechariah 11:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>which. Jer 23:2,22; Eze 34:2-6,16; Mt 23:2-4,13-29; Lu 12:45,46 Joh 10:12,13 cut off. or, hidden. neither. Ge 33:13; 1Sa 17:34,35; Isa 40:11 feed. or, bear. but. Ge 31:38; Eze 34:10,21; Joh 10:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-11-17","title":"Zechariah 11:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Woe. Jer 22:1; Eze 13:3; 34:2; Mt 23:13,16; Lu 11:42-52 idol. Isa 9:15; 44:10; Jer 23:32; 1Co 8:4; 10:19,20 that leaveth. Joh 10:12,13 the sword. Isa 6:9,10; 29:10; 42:19,20; Jer 50:35-37; Ho 4:5-7; Am 8:9,10 Mic 3:6,7; Joh 9:39; 12:40; Ro 11:7 his arm. 1Sa 2:31; 1Ki 13:4; Eze 30:22-24</p>"}]}